                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Last Hours Of Jack is pretty much company Apple caricatured as company filled with zombies since the leader [strike] Steve J... text [/strike] Dick Johnson wanted to low costs of employees and got around some shady governmental test program. Jack starts his day by fixing DJ's laptop since it was polluted by too many kitten videos from net and this causes him to gain access to level where zombies are working since there is some issues found on those laptops too. That's when all hell breaks loose and Jacks survival begins.\n\nThis means breaking office apart for weapons to whack some zombies around and finding solutions to progress through beefy janitor, safety door and so on. Over all gameplay is all out mayhem on several levels of the office building where people either flee or fight the zombies. \n\nPretty fun short games if you can handle some dick jokes and bit off and odd camera, but got used to it pretty fast. Otherwise game worked well for it's several different little ideas from which perhaps lights out moment was tad not so easy to do.",
